  "bio": "Sarah Blum is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in the distinctive watercolor style, based in Emstek, Germany. Her work stands out for its vibrant color play and fluid designs, which has earned her a resident artist position at sarah_l_moon and guest artist opportunities at yorikus24. Sarah's commitment to her craft ensures that each piece is as unique and expressive as her clients envision.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Emstek, Lower-saxony, Germany"
